OL,3,GNEWSAUber wins bid to throw out #200m
OL,4,Ablack cab claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FUber has won its bid to throw out
OL,7,Fclaims worth about #340m brought by
OL,8,Fthousands of London black cab drivers
OL,9,Fand two former private hire firms.
OL,11,FThe claimants alleged the ride-hailing
OL,12,Fcompany gave Transport for London (TfL)
OL,13,Fmisleading information when it first
OL,14,Fgot a licence to operate in the capital
OL,15,Fin 2012.
OL,17,FBut a High Court judge ruled the cases
OL,18,Fhad been brought too late and dismissed
OL,19,Fthem without considering whether the
OL,20,Fallegations were true.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
